arily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101434695", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021874544", "personaname": "Tiburónaguayo ESP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198021874544/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 8237, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2378, "last_played": 1715118500, "avatar": "11a3c5c7d19eab7470ff5b2a5ae745d279b1a4c9"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Poco contenido. Mutaciones monotonas e infinitas, apenas puedes moverte, matas a uno y te salen 3. Y una dificultad extrema. Por no hablar de los pocos modos de juego que tiene. Bastante decepcionado, sobretodo para un juego nada barato.", "timestamp_created": 1634904560, "timestamp_updated": 1634904560, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101418786", "author": {"steamid": "76561198812583561", "personaname": "La Connie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198812583561/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4173, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1007, "last_played": 1785458425, "avatar": "1953cebbb8903d9b406fedcc33cb0757664d32c4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Juego wenardo, me encanto la modernizacion del juego, las miras y todo eso :D, left 4 dead si es distinto, pero hay que darle oportunidad a esto, aunque igual , no e visto casi jugadores en las partidas que jueguen en PC", "timestamp_created": 1634871333, "timestamp_updated": 1634871333, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101414216", "author": {"steamid": "76561198826308711", "personaname": "RaiVax", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RaiVax98/", "num_games_owned": 399, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1173, "last_played": 1717390430, "avatar": "4c555ad0eef2cb39c499d44245dc5e8a836f15ef"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Right now the game is not worth the money it costs, i really hope to change my opinion about it on the future but right now i am really disappointed, and those are the reasons:\n\nThe game has an incredible lack of content and creativity, it feels like you are playing a loop game, just changing the direction of the objectives.\n\nThere is only two gamemodes campaing and pvp mode / where did horde mode go?\n\nNo progression on single player mode you are just going to play solo for learning the mechanics and thats it, no rewards, xp, supply points, 0.\n\nOne of the most important things that i think we all will miss is workshop, a huge community of players being able to create content for the game raise incredibly the game experience, being able to get skins, play a huge ammount of maps and gamemodes. But now all is up to the dev team.\n\nI know the game is recently launched, for this reason i said that there can be huge changes on the beginning. \n\nSo if you dont want to play a game that you will uninstall after completing the story, or that you want to play by your own but you want to get archievements or rewards, wait till they post new content or be patient for the steam sales and hope it costs less than the half it is right now.\n", "timestamp_created": 1634861996, "timestamp_updated": 1634861996, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 33, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.700447499752044678", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}